{"text": "i\nj\n|\n|\n|\ni\n\nFILTER Packaging \u2014\n\nGradual\n\nJoe, as we previously discussed, the Brand Group would like to\n\ninitiate a gradual-change package design project for CAMEL FILTER.\n\nThe objectives of this project will be as follows:\n\nlL\n\nTo up-grade \u2018the current\u2019 CAMEL FILTER pa\u2018\nmake it more modern/contemporary,,\n\nca es\nage to\n\nTo increase the young male appeal of the current\nCAMEL FILTER package. \u00a9 verre ce\nTo improve communication of \"filter\" cigarette.\nTo institute the necessary design changes on a\nstep-by-step basis, over.time, to minimize consumer\nrecognition that a package design change has been\naffected.\n\nWe feel that Bob Morona should be given first consideration for\n\nthis project.\nexcellent work on our recently completed design project.\n\nHe is familiar with the Brand, and I feel he did\nIn fact,\n\nhe has already presented a couple of options that we feel take the\n\ncurrent design in the general direction outlined in the above\n\nobjectives.\n\nIf you are in agreement, please obtain a design cost estimate from\ndeMartin & Morona as the first step on this project.\n\nIf you have any questions or comments, please call.\n\nces: jw\n\nCraig C. Standen\n\nJ. F. Hind\n\nMr. R. B, Beasley\n\nAttachment\n\nx\n3\n\nt\n|", "words": [{"text": "i", "x0": 10, "y0": 553, "x1": 12, "y1": 567, "conf": 53.0}, {"text": "j", "x0": 9, "y0": 568, "x1": 12, "y1": 585, "conf": 0.0}, {"text": "|", "x0": 9, "y0": 587, "x1": 12, "y1": 608, "conf": 88.0}, {"text": "|", "x0": 9, "y0": 609, "x1": 12, "y1": 642, "conf": 77.0}, {"text": "|", "x0": 9, "y0": 653, "x1": 12, "y1": 673, "conf": 49.0}, {"text": "i", "x0": 9, "y0": 710, "x1": 11, "y1": 721, "conf": 47.0}, {"text": "FILTER", "x0": 148, "y0": 88, "x1": 204, "y1": 103, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Packaging", "x0": 212, "y0": 88, "x1": 317, "y1": 106, "conf": 92.0}, {"text": "\u2014", "x0": 307, "y0": 84, "x1": 322, "y1": 112, "conf": 79.0}, {"text": "Gradual", "x0":